🎥 Live Object Detection, Counting & Alerts

A real-time object detection and tracking web app built with Streamlit, YOLOv8, and WebRTC.
This application detects objects from a live webcam feed, counts detected objects, and automatically saves alert images whenever a target object is found.

🚀 Features
📷 Real-time webcam object detection
🧠 Powered by YOLOv8 (yolov8n.pt)
🔍 Object tracking with persistent IDs
📊 Live object counting overlay
🚨 Automatic alert system for specific objects
💾 Saves detection snapshots locally
⚡ Fast and lightweight Streamlit interface

🛠️ Technologies Used
Python
Streamlit
Streamlit WebRTC
Ultralytics YOLOv8
OpenCV
AV (PyAV)
